Skills roadmap for IT professionals targeting fintech or banking technology roles: Must-haves: strong understanding of ACID transactions, distributed payment systems, regulatory compliance basics (PCI-DSS, GDPR), event-driven architecture (Kafka), and security (encryption at rest and in transit, OAuth2). Nice-to-haves: ISO 20022 messaging standard, core banking system architecture knowledge.ÿÿÿÿÿÿ